<li>&lt;a href="Riau"&gt;Riau&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Jambi"&gt;Jambi&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Sumatra%20Selatan"&gt;Sumatra Selatan&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Bengkulu"&gt;Bengkulu&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Lampung"&gt;Lampung&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Bangka%20Belitung"&gt;Kapuloan Bangka Belitung&lt;/a&gt;* (henteu aya di pulo Sumatra sacara &lt;a href="harpiah"&gt;harpiah&lt;/a&gt;).</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Riau"&gt;Kapuloan Riau&lt;/a&gt;* (henteu aya di pulo Sumatra sacara &lt;a href="harpiah"&gt;harpiah&lt;/a&gt;).</li>
